      "rights_basis": "The underlying 1755 Latin printing is public domain in the United States: publication at Rome in 1755, before the pre 1931 boundary applicable in 2026. Faithful mechanical scans add no original authorship. These four pages contain only book pages, without Google's front usage leaves. No modern translation or protected scholarly apparatus is included. The historical text and third-party scans are excluded from Triptych's CC BY 4.0 licence.",
